[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3815432434","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115540#issuecomment-3815432434","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115540","id":3815432434,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7jauDy","user":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-29T04:28:31Z","updated_at":"2026-01-29T04:28:31Z","body":"I downloaded assets from GDQuest and tried them, but I couldn't reproduce the issue.\n\nFrom GDQuest:\n<img width=\"1154\" height=\"905\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fcc91990-7097-40d2-8adf-3ccb91ed958a\" />\n\nI checked the MRP, but the asset links are broken. Since I believe it's an asset translated from the included bat file, I re-linked it and opened the scene, only to find the MeshInstance scale set to 0. Could this value be set unintentionally in some cases?\n\nMRP:\n<img width=\"1150\" height=\"681\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d68596d8-158a-4793-9658-2c6521a30efb\