o showing this and also another file with this project. \n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c1c10c01-4eae-4644-a8fc-b58b7dc7c71d\n\n[folder2.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/24937988/folder2.zip)","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3817645644/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3818807022","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115540#issuecomment-3818807022","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115540","id":3818807022,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7jnl7u","user":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-29T16:30:14Z","updated_at":"2026-01-29T16:38:14Z","body":"This appears to be deterministic behavior (same as \"write default\" behavior in Unity), not a bug. I expect the same behavior to occur in 4.5, and in that case, this is the intended behavior. You can use the RESET Animation to set default values or disable the Deterministic checkbox to avoid unintended values (the default for `Color` is `Color(0, 0, 0, 1)`, and the default for `Vector3` is `Vector3(0, 0, 0)` as Variant).\n\nSee also https://godotengine.org/article/migrating-animations-from-godot-4-0-to-4-3/#deterministic-blending and https://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/tutorials/animation/animation_tree.html#for-better-blending.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3818807022/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3819116215","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115540#issuecomment-3819116215","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115540","id":3819116215,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7joxa3","user":{"login":"justovezes","id":245887545,"node_id":"U_kgDODqfyOQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/245887545?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/justovezes","html_url":"https://github.com/justovezes","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justovezes/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justovezes/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justovezes/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justovezes/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justovezes/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justovezes/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justovezes/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justovezes/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justovezes/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-29T17:19:01Z","updated_at":"2026-01-29T17:19:01Z","body":"that was it. my bad and sorry for wasting your guys time there","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3819116215/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]